🌦️ Weather Multi-Agent Platform (Agentic AI)

A locally run, fully agentic weather assistant built with LangGraph, MCP (Model Context Protocol), FastAPI and Streamlit.

A Planner (supervisor LLM) observes the state and decides the next step. It replans after every result, including failures.
Three worker agents are autonomous tool-using LLM agents. Each one chooses which MCP tool to call, with which arguments, and self-corrects when a call fails.
All external access goes through one local MCP server: geocoding, weather, and risk rules.
